WEBVTT

00:00:03.412 --> 00:00:05.103
I <b>speak</b> English.

00:00:07.437 --> 00:00:09.396
They <b>live</b> in an apartment.

00:00:11.746 --> 00:00:14.397
My mother <b>cooks</b> great food.

00:00:16.718 --> 00:00:18.218
I <b>don’t drink</b> tea.

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:22.701
We <b>don’t have</b> a garden.

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:27.024
He <b>doesn’t play</b> the guitar.